<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All the walls are crushed and broken,</l><l>And the gates once burned with fire,</l><l>But we will not be discouraged,</l><l>Our spirits never tire.</l><l>Let the enemy oppose us;</l><l>We will fight and build our part.</l><l>To God this is our memorial;</l><l>Remember, Lord, my heart!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now the walls are high and mighty;</l><l>All our foes, they shake in fear.</l><l>The people return and they gather</l><l>God’s Holy Word to hear.</l><l>We may mourn and weep in sorrow,</l><l>But our God wants us to feast.</l><l>Come in, eat the fat, drink the sweet wine!</l><l>O Lord, we’re blessing Thee!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
